What is it that im trying to solve?
Lots of people find it challenging to keep track of thier daily expenses. Without all records saved its hard to monitor spending habits 
and manage personel finances.

What idea did you arrive at to solve it?
I developed an application called the "Personal Expense Tracker" using python. It has a simple menu to make it easy to use and navigate. 
This app will help you to easily add,view,edit,delete and search all your expenses. it also provides the user with a category summary and 
calculates the total expenditure.
